\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 6. Future Considerations & Notes\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls15\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 AI Privacy Roadmap:
\f1\b0  Currently, the system relies on cloud-based LLM APIs. Because the current deployment is strictly single-user on a private home lab, this is an acceptable privacy trade-off. For a future public release, the system will pivot to a strict "Opt-in API Key" model, with native support to connect to a user-provided local LLM (like Ollama) for 100% offline, private inference.\
\ls15\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Context Menus:
\f1\b0  Full desktop-style right-click context menus (e.g., 
\f2\fs26 @radix-ui/react-context-menu
\f1\fs24 ) will be layered in later once the core keyboard navigation and click targets feel natural.\
